Short:    Generates modem statestic as bulletin for ABBS.
uploader: kaim@powertech.no (Kai Michelsen)
author:   kaim@powertech.no (Kai Michelsen)
type:     comm/bbs

What is this?
-------------

Modemstat scan the logfiles for abbs and generate a graffical
bulletin over modem speeds and compressions. 

How to use
----------

Copy RPstart and RPstart.info to your wbstartup or add RPstart in
your startup-sequence. Modemstat will not work before RPstart is running.
copy rprexxplsextnd.library to libs:

Usage: Modemstat <node number(s)> <grab name> <bulletin>
EG   : Modemstat 12 HTH abbs:bulletins/news2
       will scan logfiles for node 1 and 2

EG2  : Modemstat 19673 HTH abbs:bulletins/news2
       will scan logfiles 1, 3, 6, 7 and 9 in numberic order.

If you want to test it in a shell or cli just use the * char and the
output will be displayed in your shell or cli.

EG3  : Modemstat 1 HTH *
       will scan node 1 and display the output in the current
       shell or cli window.


Requirements
------------

An amiga with atleast 68020 and OS2
RPstart
and ABBS ofcourse :-)


History
-------

V1.0 - Never released, done in 1994

V1.1 - First release - 18/9-1995
       Added more modem speeds
       Removed redirection. Now the program write the bulletin.
       Source is optimized and compiled with RexxPlus for max speed.

V1.2 - 2'nd release - 22/11-1995
       Added number of grabs (QWK/Other)
       Thanx to Pierre Andersen for the idea.
